message: "If you use this software or model, please cite it as below."
title: "Saffron adulteration detection with transfer learning and an in-browser Grad-CAM classifier"
abstract: >-
  Five-class image classification of saffron threads (two pure drying methods and three common
  counterfeits) using ImageNet transfer learning (ResNet50V2 selected over EfficientNetB3 and DenseNet121),
  reaching 97.3% accuracy on a held-out test set, with Grad-CAM explanations and a TensorFlow.js web app
  that runs entirely in the browser. Rebuilt from a B.Tech thesis at IIT Kharagpur.
